      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{61c4b4d1e53b1b757f010296|full_name}: Well, I don't think anyone really asks for VRChat itself running natively, as long as it's fine on Proton (at least that's true for most people). And this really makes sense, as otherwise creators would have to start uploading content for three Platforms (Windows, Android and Linux).\nBut since content creation is done natively on Linux (since the Unity editor won't run under Wine, only natively), the Creator Companion should support that type of installation as well.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
