      "value": "Mac compatibility would also be quite helpful, since I'm well aware that many Quest users are Quest users because they own a Mac and no other computer. Creator Companion only SDK means they will no longer be able to upload content (which they could all the way up to now very easily)\nUnity works, SDK works, the whole avatar creation process from start to finish works, but the shift to CC only would brick it right in the middle.",
